{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-e0ef10c6e905","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-e0ef10c6e905","name":"微波炉荷包蛋","category":"breakfast","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/breakfast/%E5%BE%AE%E6%B3%A2%E7%82%89%E8%8D%B7%E5%8C%85%E8%9B%8B.md","blob_sha":"7420231dc3bcdfb352f42a8425cad9becc1b99ad","details":{"introduction":"微波炉荷包蛋是一道便捷的家常快手菜，蛋白嫩滑、蛋黄软糯，带有芝麻油的清香。鸡蛋富含优质蛋白质和卵磷脂。做法极其简单，新手也能轻松掌握，从准备到出锅仅需约 2 分钟。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 鸡蛋\n- 芝麻油\n- 盐"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每次制作前需要确定计划做几份。一份正好够 1 个人早饭佐餐。\n\n每份：\n\n- 鸡蛋 2 个\n- 饮用水 35ml\n- 芝麻油 3ml\n- 盐 0.8g"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将鸡蛋打入小碗中，用筷子在所有鸡蛋黄上扎 2 个洞，避免加热弄脏微波炉\n2. 然后向碗内倒入常温饮用水\n3. 再向碗内倒入食用盐\n4. 最后加入芝麻油\n5. 将放好材料的碗放入微波炉中，高火加热 80 秒\n6. 到达设定时间后，使用抹布垫着手取出成品"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 微波炉加热前，如果想进一步避免蛋黄和蛋白溅射，可以在碗上盖个盖子避免弄脏微波炉"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：净全鸡蛋液150g、饮用水15g、食盐1g；整份约145g。无糖油酱，碗中添加水在家庭份成品重中处理。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":147.931034,"protein_g":13.034483,"carbohydrate_g":0.744828,"fat_g":9.837931},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","version":"a4e90f9125a95966","fdc_ids":[171287,173647,173468]},"profile_id":"family-e0ef10c6e905-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-e0ef10c6e905","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-e0ef10c6e905","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"microwave","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-e0ef10c6e905-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"egg","grams":150},{"key":"water","grams":15},{"key":"salt","grams":1}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、